### FixMock Standalone Server API Examples

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:9090/health

### 2. Register a Single Stub (NOS -> ER)
POST http://localhost:9090/__admin/stubs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pattern": {
    "msgType": "D",
    "tags": {
      "55": "AAPL"
    }
  },
  "response": {
    "type": "STATIC_ER",
    "orderId": "OID-123",
    "execId": "E-456",
    "execType": "0",
    "ordStatus": "0",
    "side": "1",
    "leavesQty": 100,
    "cumQty": 0,
    "avgPx": 0
  }
}

### 3. Register Multiple Stubs (Batch)
POST http://localhost:9090/__admin/stubs
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "pattern": { "msgType": "D", "tags": { "55": "MSFT" } },
    "response": { "type": "STATIC_ER", "execType": "0", "ordStatus": "0" }
  },
  {
    "pattern": { "msgType": "F" },
    "response": { "type": "STATIC_ER", "execType": "4", "ordStatus": "4" }
  }
]

### 4. Verify a Message Received (Exactly 1 NOS for AAPL)
POST http://localhost:9090/__admin/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countType": "EXACTLY",
  "count": 1,
  "pattern": {
    "msgType": "D",
    "tags": {
      "55": "AAPL"
    }
  }
}

### 5. Verify at least 1 message received within the last 10 seconds
POST http://localhost:9090/__admin/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countType": "AT_LEAST",
  "count": 1,
  "withinMillis": 10000,
  "pattern": {
    "msgType": "D"
  }
}

### 6. List all journaled requests
GET http://localhost:9090/__admin/requests

### 7. Filter journaled requests by session and msgType
GET http://localhost:9090/__admin/requests?msgType=D&sessionId=FIX.4.4:BROKER->CLIENT

### 8. Export recorded stubs (from Recording Mode)
GET http://localhost:9090/__admin/recordings

### 9. Reset server (Clear stubs and journal)
DELETE http://localhost:9090/__admin/reset
